<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FAI shareholders approve pref issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FAI shareholders approve pref issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAI Insurances Ltd said on Monday that shareholders approved its issue of 25 million converting preference shares at A$2 each to raise A$50 million.</p>
<p>The shares would have a five year term and a dividend yield of 8.25 percent fully franked.</p>
<p>At 1.10 p.m. (0210 GMT), FAI shares were steady at 71 cents a share.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
